  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Emergency relief - earthquake in Turkey and Syria</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">On the morning of February 6, a 7.9 magnitude earthquake struck the border region of Turkey and Syria, followed the same day by another 7.5 magnitude earthquake. Even if we are not normally active in the region, our network with Visions for Children e.V. gives us the opportunity to implement humanitarian emergency aid.  More than 10,000 people have already died, another 49,000 are injured and local help is urgently needed. Please support us and donate now for the survivors.</narrative>
  </description>
